"Mordor"
END

Map:MAPWORMordor/Desc
"This inhospitable landscape is the realm of the Dark Lord Sauron. In this region also lies Mount Doom where the One Ring was created and eventually destroyed.\n\n Size: 500 x 500\n Lairs: 2x Goblin Lair, 4x Troll Lair, 2x Fire Drake Lair\n Neutral Structures: 4x Shipwright"
END

