Map:MAPMPBrownLands/Desc
"Lands to the east of the River Anduin scorched by Sauron at the end of the Second Age. Once the lush home of the Entwives, this area has been desolate since the battles of the Last Alliance.\n\n Size: 500 x 500\n Lairs: 10x Goblin Lair\n Neutral Structures:"
END

MAP:MAPMPEastEmnet
"East Emnet"
END

MAP:MAPMPEastEmnet/Desc
"The eastern plains of Rohan, dotted with nomadic settlements and farmlands.\n\n Size: 480 x 360\n Lairs: 2x Warg Lair, 3x Troll Lair\n Neutral Structures: 1x Inn"
END

Map:MAPMPEastMarch
"East March"
END

Map:MAPMPEastMarch/Desc
"A small but densely populated sliver of land between the Old Forest and the east bank of the Brandywine river, inhabited by Hobbits.\n\n Size: 600 x 500\n Lairs: 8x Goblin Lair, 8x Troll Lair\n Neutral Structures: 1x Tower"
END

MAP:MAPMPEasternRohan
"Eastern Rohan"
END

MAP:MAPMPEasternRohan/Desc
"Lush green lands in Eastern Rohan, bisected by the Entwash River.\n\n Size: 270 x 420\n Lairs: 6x Warg Lair\n Neutral Structures: 2x Outpost, 2x Inn, 2x Signal Fire"
END

Map:MAPMPEastfold
"Eastfold"
END

Map:MAPMPEastfold/Desc
"A region of Rohan which bordered the Westfold via the Snowbourn River on the west and Anorien in Gondor to the east.\n\n Size: 400 x 350\n Lairs: 4x Warg Lair, 2x Troll Lair\n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn"
END

Map:MAPMPEredLuinValley
"Ered Luin Valley"
END

Map:MAPMPEredLuinValley/Desc
"A vast valley in the eastern parts of the Blue Mountains. \n\n Size: 440 x 390\n Lairs: 2x Goblin Lair, 2x Troll lair\n Neutral Structures: 2x Signal Fire"
END

Map:MAPMPFordsOfGlanduin
"Fords of Glanduin"
END

Map:MAPMPFordsOfGlanduin/Desc
"Beginning in the Hithaeglir south of Khazad-dum, the Glanduin formed Eregion's southern boundary to Dunland.\n\n Size: 500 x 500\n Lairs: 4x Warg Lair, 2x Troll Lair\n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn, 2x Signal Fire"
END

Map:MAPMPFrostfallCanyon
"Frostfall Canyon"
END

Map:MAPMPFrostfallCanyon/Desc
"Secret valleys located deep within the Grey Mountains \n\n Size: 470 x 470\n Lairs: 6x Warg Lair, 2x Goblin Lair, 2x Troll Lair, 4x Wight Lair\n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn, 1x Outpost"
END

Map:MAPMPFrozenRift
"Frozen Rift"
END

Map:MAPMPFrozenRift/Desc
"An icy rift that can be found in the frozen wastelands of the North, close to the Ice Bay of Forochel. The Lossoth are amongst the few who dare brave these frozen lands.\n\n Size: 500 x 500\n Lairs: 2x Goblin Lair, 2x Troll Lair\n Neutral Structures: 1x Signal Fire"
END

Map:MAPMPGondorOutpost
"Gondor Outpost"
END

Map:MAPMPGondorOutpost/Desc
"An outpost on the border of Harondor which served to keep watch of the southern roads.\n\n Size: 500 x 500\n Lairs: 8x Warg Lair\n Neutral Structures: 1x Outpost"
END

Map:MAPMPGreenleafForest
"Greenleaf Forest"
END

Map:MAPMPGreenleafForest/Desc
"After the fall of Sauron in the Third Age, Mirkwood was cleansed and became Eryn Lasgalen, a fair forest once again.\n\n Size: 425 x 410\n Lairs: 5x Spider Lair \n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn, 1x Signal Fire"
END

Map:MAPMPHitherLandsOfKhand
"Hither Lands of Khand"
END

Map:MAPMPHitherLandsOfKhand/Desc
"A desert wasteland where pools of fresh water can be found.\n\n Size: 465 x 430\n Lairs: 2x Goblin Lair, 4x Troll lair\n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn"
END

Map:MAPMPJunglesofFarHarad
"Jungles of Far Harad"
END

Map:MAPMPJunglesofFarHarad/Desc
"A region in the very south of Far Harad densely forested with tropical trees and bushes. It is supplied with water from rivers which ultimately flow out into the Great Sea.\n\n Size: 380 x 400\n Lairs: 4x Warg Lair, 2x Troll Lair\n Neutral Structures: 2x Signal Fire"
END

Map:MAPMPLamedon
"Lamedon"
END

Map:MAPMPLamedon/Desc
"Lamedon was a region and fiefdom in southern Gondor, a series of valleys through which the Ringlo and Ciril rivers flowed south.\n\n Size: 600 x 600\n Lairs: 2x Warg Lair, 4x Troll Lair\n Neutral Structures: 2x Inn, 2x Outpost, 2x Signal Fire"
END

MAP:MAPMPMirkwoodForest
"Mirkwood Forest"
END

MAP:MAPMPMirkwoodForest/Desc
"A dark and treacherous forest located in the north-western part of Middle-earth \n\n Size: 380 x 380\n Lairs: 4x Warg Lair, 2x Troll Lair\n Neutral Structures: 2x Signal Fire"
END

Map:MAPMPMoongladeVale
"Moonglade Vale"
END

Map:MAPMPMoongladeVale/Desc
"A moonforest which the Elves of Middle-earth revere in adoration of Varda, creator of starlight, whom they call Elbereth.\n\n Size: 480 x 480\n Lairs: 2x Troll Lair, 2x Goblin Cave\n Netural Structures:"
